Package: com.t4mag0.safarimodernizer
Name: SafariModernizer
Description: Makes newer websites work and look modern in Safari on iOS 15. Adds modern JavaScript and web features, rewrites modern CSS, works around Safari 15 security-policy bugs, runs sites that need import maps, and identifies as Safari 18.6 so sites send their modern pages. Hold two fingers on a page for 2 seconds (or add #smdebug to the address) to open the log and per-site settings.
